ronment configured in `~/.bashrc`:**\r\n- `KLEE_RUNTIME_DIRECTORY=/usr/local/lib/klee/runtime`\r\n- `CPATH` includes `/usr/local/include/klee` and `/usr/local/include`\r\n\r\n**Verification:**\r\n- `klee` is callable from the command line\r\n- `klee --version` shows KLEE 3.4-pre with LLVM 16.0.6\r\n- `stp --version` shows STP 2.4.1\r\n- A test program compiled with `clang-16 -emit-llvm` runs successfully under KLEE using STP/CaDiCaL backend\r\n- The `klee/klee.h` header is findable via `CPATH`\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=96 surface=be646ee64542\r\n"]
